WEBVTT

00:02.700 --> 00:04.850
What... are you doing?

00:05.620 --> 00:06.730
Aoi?

00:06.730 --> 00:08.370
Hey, what's this about?

00:08.370 --> 00:10.190
Explain this in detail-

00:10.530 --> 00:11.470
Come here for a bit.

00:11.470 --> 00:12.690
Wai-

00:24.000 --> 00:27.340
Don't give up and do your best

00:27.340 --> 00:30.710
Try your luck and fight! Chin-up!

00:30.710 --> 00:33.760
I know perfectly

00:33.760 --> 00:37.430
How weak a person is on their own

00:37.640 --> 00:40.600
Things that are on the verge of being lost

00:40.600 --> 00:44.270
I hold them close to my chest

00:44.270 --> 00:47.230
Your gentle words

00:47.230 --> 00:51.190
Caress my cheeks

00:51.190 --> 00:54.240
The irritation that has been building up

00:54.240 --> 00:57.030
From wanting to reach the goal

00:57.030 --> 01:01.200
My heart that almost wants to burst out crying

01:01.200 --> 01:04.790
The place that warms it up

01:04.790 --> 01:07.710
Even if we have to go through the pain

01:07.710 --> 01:11.210
We have to protect this

01:11.210 --> 01:12.670
We're unripe fighters!

01:12.670 --> 01:14.590
We won't lose now

01:14.590 --> 01:17.970
We will raise our small hands up in the air

01:17.970 --> 01:21.390
Take in that vital power, embrace it

01:21.390 --> 01:24.850
Then release it towards the sky!

01:24.850 --> 01:26.390
The courage that cannot be stopped

01:26.390 --> 01:28.230
jump and shoot

01:26.390 --> 01:28.230
Tomorrow we'll jump and shoot!

01:28.230 --> 01:31.150
I will pass the ball to you

01:31.150 --> 01:35.440
The memories that are awoken by our calls

01:35.440 --> 01:38.990
Game

01:35.440 --> 01:38.990
Will move the game along

01:45.540 --> 01:49.670
Stairway to Reincarnation

01:46.910 --> 01:48.710
Why are you here?

01:48.710 --> 01:49.670
That goes for you, too.

01:50.080 --> 01:52.420
What are you doing with those elementary school girls?

01:52.420 --> 01:54.840
Oh my, has it gotten out already?

01:55.760 --> 01:57.720
Mihoshi...-chan?

01:58.590 --> 02:02.180
To think you asked Subaru, the way he is now, to coach these elementary school girls...

02:02.890 --> 02:05.640
If this got out, Subaru would be in a lot of trouble.

02:05.640 --> 02:10.270
I wouldn't do something like that, but he might be doing something wrong-

02:10.270 --> 02:11.730
Nope, nothing like that.

02:12.360 --> 02:15.320
It's not a sin to teach these elementary school girls basketball, anyway.

02:15.820 --> 02:18.110
That's... true, but...

02:18.860 --> 02:22.950
He's become an amazing coach for them.

02:22.950 --> 02:23.490
Tomoka-chan!

02:27.250 --> 02:28.250
We did it!

02:28.250 --> 02:29.000
Yeah!

02:31.830 --> 02:33.590
Thank you very much!

02:33.590 --> 02:35.760
You better get home quickly, Subaru.

02:35.760 --> 02:38.220
You understand your situation, right?

02:38.670 --> 02:39.840
Um...

02:39.840 --> 02:41.050
Come on.

02:41.550 --> 02:42.640
Hey!

02:43.350 --> 02:44.470
Um...

02:47.100 --> 02:48.350
What is it?

02:48.770 --> 02:49.640
Erm...

02:49.640 --> 02:51.100
Um...

02:53.110 --> 02:56.570
That reminds me, how come you never go under the hoop?

02:56.570 --> 02:58.150
You're so tal-

02:58.150 --> 02:59.780
What's the matter?

02:59.780 --> 03:01.610
It's nothing...

03:01.610 --> 03:03.700
Thank you for your hard work!

03:06.330 --> 03:09.080
There's nothing bad about you coaching basketball,

03:09.080 --> 03:11.580
but you've got to look out for yourself, too.

03:11.580 --> 03:13.250
You've even got a test coming up.

03:13.250 --> 03:14.340
I'll do it.

03:14.340 --> 03:15.840
I'll do it properly.

03:15.840 --> 03:17.050
That's not possible.

03:17.050 --> 03:20.470
Basically, you can't focus on things other than basketball.

03:21.470 --> 03:23.300
Seems like I've got no choice.

03:23.300 --> 03:26.680
I'll hold another study session for the test this weekend.

03:28.310 --> 03:31.140
Can we come back to your pool next Saturday, too?

03:31.140 --> 03:32.650
Of course!

03:32.650 --> 03:33.850
Um...

03:33.850 --> 03:35.560
This weekend is...

03:35.560 --> 03:36.610
What is it?

03:36.610 --> 03:37.860
Do you have something going on again?

03:37.860 --> 03:41.490
I'll take care of Subaru's revision.

03:41.490 --> 03:44.320
I'll confine him in a hotel room and force him to study.

03:44.320 --> 03:45.570
There's no need to worry.

03:46.160 --> 03:47.370
Okay...

03:47.990 --> 03:49.370
You can come, too!

03:49.370 --> 03:52.500
I can arrange for you to be all alone in the room with Subaru, if you want.

03:54.380 --> 03:55.250
There's no need to!

03:55.250 --> 03:56.170
Really?

03:57.750 --> 03:59.670
Oh, that was such a shock.

03:59.670 --> 04:01.800
Who do you think that girl was?

04:01.800 --> 04:04.640
Could she be Hasegawa-san's girlfriend...?

04:04.640 --> 04:06.390
Tomo, do you know anything?

04:06.930 --> 04:08.010
Nope.

04:08.010 --> 04:09.310
I see.

04:09.310 --> 04:12.230
Even so, Airin did a great job calling out to him.

04:12.690 --> 04:16.400
I felt like Hasegawa-san would go away somewhere...

04:16.400 --> 04:19.150
Will Onii-chan disappear?

04:19.940 --> 04:21.110
Don't worry.

04:21.110 --> 04:24.610
He did say that he'd coach us until we graduate.

04:25.700 --> 04:27.370
That's right...

04:28.580 --> 04:31.160
Hey, what was that girl's name?

04:31.160 --> 04:32.290
The tall one.

04:32.290 --> 04:33.410
You talking about Airi?

04:33.410 --> 04:35.000
Don't say that she's tall.

04:35.000 --> 04:37.290
Why don't you make her play at the post?

04:38.670 --> 04:40.840
She sort of has a phobia.

04:40.840 --> 04:43.260
She's very concerned about her height, too.

04:43.720 --> 04:47.220
I don't think it's the right time to let her play centre.

04:47.890 --> 04:49.390
See you later, then.

04:59.480 --> 05:00.730
I'm going to shoot!

05:08.410 --> 05:09.490
President, get the rebound!

05:20.790 --> 05:23.340
Dislike being tall, huh?

05:29.640 --> 05:32.350
There will be times where you're off-form.

05:32.350 --> 05:34.020
There's nothing to worry about.

05:34.980 --> 05:35.980
Tomoka?

05:37.020 --> 05:39.060
Um, Subaru-san.

05:39.060 --> 05:42.610
Would it be better if I stopped coming over?

05:43.360 --> 05:44.320
Why do you say that?

05:44.780 --> 05:45.820
Wouldn't...

05:45.820 --> 05:48.030
Wouldn't your girlfriend be unhappy about this?

05:48.450 --> 05:49.410
Girlfriend?

05:49.410 --> 05:51.580
The person who came yesterday.

05:52.200 --> 05:53.700
Are you talking about Aoi?!

05:53.700 --> 05:54.870
It's nothing like that!

05:56.000 --> 05:58.500
She's just a childhood friend.

05:58.500 --> 06:00.460
We were in the basketball club at the same middle school,

06:00.460 --> 06:01.960
and we kind of got along pretty well.

06:01.960 --> 06:02.880
You're getting the wrong idea.

06:02.880 --> 06:04.300
I see.

06:04.880 --> 06:09.890
Our practice time every morning is important to me, too.

06:09.890 --> 06:11.220
I'll be looking forward to future sessions, too.

06:12.640 --> 06:14.060
Yes!

06:17.480 --> 06:18.980
Good morning, everyone!

06:18.980 --> 06:20.560
Good morning, Mo-kan!

06:20.560 --> 06:21.270
You know what?

06:21.270 --> 06:24.070
He said that the person who came yesterday wasn't his girlfriend!

06:24.070 --> 06:27.070
He also said he'd come and coach us, just as he promised.

06:27.530 --> 06:29.360
I'm glad.

06:29.360 --> 06:30.660
Tomo, you're so impatient.

06:30.660 --> 06:32.660
Everyone's worrying too much.

06:32.660 --> 06:35.870
Subarun won't have an affair with anyone except us.

06:35.870 --> 06:36.910
Oh~!

06:36.910 --> 06:40.670
Hina will become Onii-chan's bride!

06:40.670 --> 06:43.170
You shouldn't say such things so casually!

06:43.170 --> 06:46.300
Gosh, think before you talk.

06:46.300 --> 06:47.800
Saki, you look a bit flushed.

06:47.800 --> 06:50.010
I'm not-

06:50.010 --> 06:51.220
Stupid Maho.

06:59.230 --> 07:00.520
Isn't that great?

07:00.520 --> 07:03.230
Sensei finally got into the mood for studying, right?

07:03.230 --> 07:07.570
Well, it's a pity that our President didn't get a chance to shine.

07:07.570 --> 07:11.070
I thought their love would've progressed.

07:11.070 --> 07:12.160
Right~?

07:12.160 --> 07:13.490
Love?!

07:13.490 --> 07:14.990
There's nothing like that between us.

07:14.990 --> 07:17.120
You should just give up and admit it.

07:17.550 --> 07:20.330
The two of you were captains of both
basketball club teams in middle school.

07:20.330 --> 07:22.040
You two are a fitting couple.

07:22.040 --> 07:24.880
That's a different story.

07:24.880 --> 07:28.840
The guys' team was strong, and I just wanted to cheer him on.

07:29.340 --> 07:31.090
You almost made it, though.

07:31.090 --> 07:32.470
Yeah.

07:32.470 --> 07:35.760
But everyone worked hard to win this runner-up title.

07:36.850 --> 07:39.310
Well, our exams are all that's left.

07:39.310 --> 07:40.810
That's right.

07:40.810 --> 07:42.730
You're going to Nashiba High, right?

07:42.730 --> 07:43.440
Yeah.

07:43.440 --> 07:45.860
I'd get a sports recommendation if I went there, too.

07:46.690 --> 07:51.570
When I become a high school student, I'll aim to be the national champion.

07:52.450 --> 07:55.410
I wonder if he forgot all about that...

07:55.410 --> 07:59.830
You even quit basketball and wanted to become their manager.

07:59.830 --> 08:02.250
But then the club suspension incident came along, huh?

08:02.250 --> 08:03.710
Cheer up, President!

08:03.710 --> 08:05.920
Sensei will make a comeback next year!

08:09.710 --> 08:12.130
I think I'll pass these to him.

08:12.840 --> 08:14.680
Sorry to have bothered you.

08:16.180 --> 08:19.100
Subaru!

08:24.940 --> 08:25.850
All right!

08:25.850 --> 08:27.360
If you've finished your warm-ups, let's start-

08:27.360 --> 08:30.690
Excuse me, Subaru-sama. You have a guest.

08:33.740 --> 08:34.610
Aoi!

08:35.070 --> 08:36.780
Why are you...?

08:36.780 --> 08:38.120
Why?

08:38.120 --> 08:41.290
That's my line!

08:49.380 --> 08:50.800
Geez, Yanbarun!

08:50.800 --> 08:53.510
Why did you let her in?

08:53.510 --> 08:55.930
I'm sorry for intruding so abruptly.

08:55.930 --> 08:57.260
But...

08:57.260 --> 09:01.140
First you lie to me, and then you go to the pool, dressed in trunks, with girls?

09:01.140 --> 09:02.600
It seems to me like you're having <i>so</i> much fun.

09:03.060 --> 09:04.100
It's a misunderstanding!

09:04.100 --> 09:08.360
Airi is bad at swimming, and I just
want to help teach her how to swim.

09:08.730 --> 09:10.230
If it's basketball, I can still understand.

09:10.230 --> 09:11.320
Just barely.

09:11.320 --> 09:14.030
But you're not a swimming coach, are you?

09:14.030 --> 09:16.610
Is this so important that you would go so far as to sacrifice your tests for it?

09:16.610 --> 09:18.780
Stop putting it that way!

09:18.780 --> 09:20.870
If this allows to Airi gain confidence,

09:20.870 --> 09:22.950
it'll also help her in basketball!

09:22.950 --> 09:25.000
There's a proper purpose behind this!

09:26.170 --> 09:27.750
You really have some serious issues!

09:27.750 --> 09:29.290
You're being way too kind.

09:29.290 --> 09:30.670
When it comes to basketball,

09:30.670 --> 09:32.500
you accept anything without thinking,

09:32.500 --> 09:34.300
and throw away all your time.

09:35.090 --> 09:35.760
Wai-

09:35.760 --> 09:36.720
What are you doing?

09:36.720 --> 09:37.680
We're going back!

09:37.680 --> 09:39.010
Isn't it obvious?

09:39.010 --> 09:40.140
I'm not going back!

09:40.140 --> 09:41.760
Are you an idiot?!

09:41.760 --> 09:43.930
What are you going to do if you fail your tests?

09:43.930 --> 09:46.230
It's just a small basketball club!

09:46.230 --> 09:47.100
Leave me alone!

09:47.100 --> 09:52.020
Teaching these girls how to play basketball and how to swim are just as important as my own concerns!

09:52.020 --> 09:53.030
Huh?!

09:53.030 --> 09:55.610
You can't take care of yourself properly,
so why are you speaking so highly of yourself?

09:55.610 --> 09:57.070
I'm going to bring you back no matter what!

09:57.070 --> 09:59.570
I told you, I'm not going back!

10:01.030 --> 10:02.830
Don't take Subarun away!

10:02.830 --> 10:05.450
Hasegawa-san is our coach!

10:05.450 --> 10:11.380
It's just swimming today, but everyone wants to work hard for Airi's sake!

10:12.380 --> 10:14.670
Aoi, listen to me.

10:14.670 --> 10:18.380
It's because of them that I got back my passion for basketball.

10:19.720 --> 10:23.390
I wanted to teach them as a coach, but in fact,

10:23.390 --> 10:26.430
I learnt so many things from them instead.

10:27.480 --> 10:31.190
They'll definitely be useful when the
basketball club is reinstated next year.

10:31.190 --> 10:32.400
That's why...

10:32.400 --> 10:34.650
Could you leave us for now, Aoi?

10:35.280 --> 10:39.400
Subaru-san is the reason why we can smile like this now.

10:39.780 --> 10:42.830
Onii-chan will always be with Hina.

10:42.830 --> 10:44.240
Please!

10:45.410 --> 10:48.330
Each one of us needs Hasegawa-san!

10:50.710 --> 10:51.750
Fine.

10:51.750 --> 10:52.750
I get it.

10:53.170 --> 10:56.090
I'll challenge you all to a basketball match with Subaru as the wager.

10:59.170 --> 11:00.340
I'll do it.

11:00.880 --> 11:02.050
Exactly what we want!

11:02.050 --> 11:06.270
If we win, you'll acknowledge Hasegawa-san as our coach, right?

11:06.270 --> 11:07.720
Of course.

11:07.720 --> 11:08.770
If you lose,

11:08.770 --> 11:09.940
you know what will happen.

11:10.390 --> 11:11.440
We won't lose.

11:11.440 --> 11:12.770
No matter what.

11:19.070 --> 11:20.900
If that's what you want, President, then it's fine.

11:20.900 --> 11:22.030
Obviously!

11:22.030 --> 11:24.450
Sorry for dragging you guys in.

11:24.450 --> 11:28.000
But, I want to confirm something.

11:36.040 --> 11:38.170
Why swimsuits?

11:38.170 --> 11:42.510
Well, we heard there was a pool here, so we were thinking about having some fun afterwards.

11:42.510 --> 11:43.180
Right~?

11:44.050 --> 11:45.760
Why must I do this, too?

11:45.760 --> 11:49.390
Let's get this over with and continue with Airin's swimming lessons.

11:49.390 --> 11:50.770
Let's do our best~!

11:50.770 --> 11:51.980
Yeah!

11:57.320 --> 11:59.690
First to ten points wins.

11:59.690 --> 12:02.360
Are you sure you don't want a jump ball, Aoi?

12:02.360 --> 12:05.320
There's an age difference, so we should have a handicap.

12:05.320 --> 12:07.530
In exchange, referee fairly.

12:07.530 --> 12:09.160
Of course.

12:11.750 --> 12:12.370
Maho!

12:12.370 --> 12:13.500
Got it!

12:17.040 --> 12:17.750
Oh~!

12:17.750 --> 12:18.340
Saki!

12:18.340 --> 12:19.170
Got it!

12:23.630 --> 12:24.930
First point!

12:26.640 --> 12:27.800
Not bad.

12:27.800 --> 12:29.350
When did you start?

12:29.350 --> 12:31.020
Two months ago.

12:44.200 --> 12:45.450
Oops.

12:51.830 --> 12:53.960
Man, I missed.

12:53.960 --> 12:55.290
What a pity.

12:55.290 --> 12:56.880
We're going back.

12:56.880 --> 12:58.380
Okay~

13:05.090 --> 13:06.300
Sorry!

13:06.300 --> 13:06.970
Here, Zano!

13:06.970 --> 13:08.050
Okay!

13:11.470 --> 13:13.810
You're the source of their confidence, right?

13:13.810 --> 13:14.730
Tomoka-chan.

13:14.730 --> 13:16.140
I can't lose.

13:16.140 --> 13:18.940
Everything Subaru-san has taught me...

13:18.940 --> 13:20.150
I'll bring it all out!

13:21.440 --> 13:23.360
I'm looking forward to it.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.780
Good job, Mo-kan!

13:30.780 --> 13:32.790
Yay~

13:31.280 --> 13:32.790
I see.

13:32.790 --> 13:34.710
Hai~

13:32.790 --> 13:34.710
Subaru, time-out.

13:36.370 --> 13:37.960
Everyone's doing great!

13:37.960 --> 13:38.750
Go for it!

13:38.750 --> 13:39.710
Yes!

13:40.590 --> 13:42.500
As expected, Subaru.

13:47.300 --> 13:49.430
I'm sorry, but I'll be going all out.

13:51.300 --> 13:52.720
All right!

13:53.430 --> 13:55.390
Geez, what do you want?

13:55.980 --> 13:56.850
Maho!

14:05.820 --> 14:08.360
It was just like President said.

14:08.360 --> 14:12.370
You taught them a good move to boost their confidence.

14:12.370 --> 14:14.910
No wonder they didn't dribble much.

14:14.910 --> 14:16.330
Just as the President read it.

14:16.330 --> 14:19.920
Really, she just sees through Sensei so easily.

14:19.920 --> 14:20.790
Right~?

14:21.170 --> 14:23.460
Well, we've been friends for a long time.

14:23.460 --> 14:27.420
I feel bad for you, Sensei, but we'll do as the President says.

14:27.420 --> 14:31.180
We've been indebted to the President since middle school, after all.

14:52.570 --> 14:53.870
Everyone...

14:54.370 --> 14:56.040
We're fine!

14:56.040 --> 14:57.370
We can still make it!

14:57.370 --> 14:58.620
Oh~...

14:58.620 --> 15:00.870
Subarun, what should we do to win this?

15:01.330 --> 15:02.630
Let's see...

15:02.630 --> 15:06.420
Tomoka, if Aoi comes at you, she'll probably come from the right.

15:07.260 --> 15:08.220
Yes.

15:09.630 --> 15:12.760
You still intend to make Tomoka-chan mark me?

15:13.350 --> 15:14.100
Are you a spy?!

15:14.100 --> 15:14.970
What do you want?

15:14.970 --> 15:17.310
Go back to where you belong.

15:17.310 --> 15:18.850
Hey, Tomoka-chan.

15:18.850 --> 15:20.390
Don't lose your confidence.

15:21.310 --> 15:24.360
You're really amazing, regardless of speed or form.

15:24.360 --> 15:26.940
You'll overtake me in no time.

15:26.940 --> 15:28.740
But for now, it's still not possible for you.

15:28.740 --> 15:30.400
In the first place, our heights are different.

15:31.780 --> 15:34.700
To stop me, you have to be the same height as me.

15:34.700 --> 15:36.280
Nothing but that would work.

15:36.870 --> 15:40.910
If you faced a situation like this in a
championship match, what would you do?

15:44.130 --> 15:49.300
You should carefully rethink about
what basketball really means to you.

15:54.590 --> 15:57.180
Airi, don't worry about what she just said.

15:57.180 --> 16:01.140
Even if we lost this match, I'll...

16:01.520 --> 16:02.770
I don't want to!

16:03.270 --> 16:04.770
Even though I decided...

16:04.770 --> 16:08.190
Even though I decided to work hard, and bring out all my courage...

16:11.780 --> 16:14.910
I don't want break up with Hasegawa-san!

16:14.910 --> 16:16.030
Not even for a single day!

16:16.910 --> 16:18.620
Airi...

16:27.420 --> 16:28.670
I'm sorry, Airi.

16:28.670 --> 16:30.670
I was wrong.

16:30.670 --> 16:31.970
Help me out.

16:31.970 --> 16:34.260
Stop Aoi with your power.

16:34.260 --> 16:36.720
I still want to continue on as everyone's coach.

16:38.930 --> 16:39.760
Yes!

16:39.760 --> 16:41.020
I'll try my best.

16:41.020 --> 16:42.730
Well said, Airin!

16:42.730 --> 16:44.730
Stop Aoi-san's shots!

16:44.730 --> 16:46.730
Hina will do her best, too!

16:48.440 --> 16:49.650
Let's go, everyone!

16:49.650 --> 16:51.740
To protect this place!

16:53.950 --> 16:56.280
We practised really hard together.

16:56.280 --> 16:57.950
We'll show you the results of that practice!

17:00.240 --> 17:01.870
That's the way it has to be.

17:01.870 --> 17:02.790
Here I come.

17:04.830 --> 17:05.540
Oops.

17:06.290 --> 17:07.500
Wrong, wrong.

17:07.500 --> 17:09.380
Maho-chan, you look at the ball too much.

17:09.380 --> 17:10.960
You should be looking at your opponent's face.

17:12.920 --> 17:15.300
Saki-chan, your centre of gravity is leaning too much to the right.

17:15.300 --> 17:18.220
Hinata-chan, if you don't lock your calves, you won't be able to move freely.

17:23.850 --> 17:25.140
She's...

17:28.980 --> 17:31.230
Let's see how you handle this.

17:32.150 --> 17:34.740
I can't stop you from shooting.

17:34.740 --> 17:36.030
But...

17:36.910 --> 17:38.570
You finally came.

17:38.570 --> 17:40.200
However, that's too far.

17:41.120 --> 17:44.580
Look, if you don't get closer, you can't defend!

17:44.580 --> 17:46.290
Look what happens when you don't!

17:52.210 --> 17:53.840
I'm really going to shoot next time.

17:53.840 --> 17:54.970
Are you sure you're not going to stop me?

17:56.420 --> 17:58.470
Are you so scared that you can't even get close?

17:58.470 --> 18:00.640
Then, it'll be our victory.

18:00.640 --> 18:02.100
I'll take Subaru with me.

18:02.100 --> 18:02.760
No!

18:02.760 --> 18:03.720
I don't want that to happen!

18:03.720 --> 18:05.350
You can't just be all talk!

18:05.350 --> 18:08.650
If Subaru is so important to you, do something about it!

18:08.650 --> 18:10.440
Show me that your feelings towards basketball are real!

18:11.270 --> 18:12.440
Here I come!

18:14.110 --> 18:16.860
No!

18:21.950 --> 18:23.830
Are you okay?!

18:23.830 --> 18:25.700
Ouch...

18:27.080 --> 18:28.420
Ah, I...

18:28.420 --> 18:29.670
I'm sorry!

18:29.670 --> 18:30.960
You did a good job.

18:31.920 --> 18:33.710
That was an amazing block.

18:33.710 --> 18:36.880
Airi-chan, you can definitely support everyone.

18:36.880 --> 18:38.170
You can become a good centre.

18:38.880 --> 18:40.590
Aoi-san...

18:40.590 --> 18:43.050
Ah, let's stop this.

18:43.050 --> 18:47.060
If their teamwork is this good, the three of us can't win.

18:47.060 --> 18:49.020
Zano, Shouji, are the two of you okay with this?

18:49.020 --> 18:50.310
Got it.

18:50.310 --> 18:51.270
Of course!

18:54.020 --> 18:55.440
Then...

18:55.940 --> 19:01.950
Only if you promise to study for your tests properly and reinstate the basketball club next year.

19:01.950 --> 19:02.990
Yeah.

19:02.990 --> 19:04.280
Oh~?

19:04.280 --> 19:05.740
Then have we...

19:06.200 --> 19:07.450
We've won!

19:07.450 --> 19:08.910
We did it, Subarun!

19:09.620 --> 19:10.750
Thank goodness.

19:11.210 --> 19:13.290
I feel like I have no energy left.

19:13.290 --> 19:17.210
Aoi-san, I'll try my best to be useful to everyone.

19:20.220 --> 19:23.510
I see. So you guys haven't gone to an official tournament, yet.

19:23.510 --> 19:25.060
I want to go to one as quickly as possible, though.

19:25.060 --> 19:27.720
There just aren't any opponents. Right, Shoujo-ji?

19:27.720 --> 19:29.350
I see.

19:30.190 --> 19:32.600
Your upper body floats a bit too much.

19:32.600 --> 19:34.560
I'll hold your waist, so try moving forward.

19:34.560 --> 19:35.190
Yes.

19:35.190 --> 19:36.480
You're a really great help.

19:36.480 --> 19:38.360
There are limits to what a male coach can do.

19:38.360 --> 19:39.650
That's right.

19:39.650 --> 19:42.490
As a coach, you're not allowed to touch them, all right?

19:42.490 --> 19:43.780
I wouldn't do something like that!

19:43.780 --> 19:44.820
Okay, okay.

19:44.820 --> 19:46.580
Airi-chan, let's try one more time.

19:46.580 --> 19:47.660
Yes!

19:49.290 --> 19:50.660
Hey, Aoi.

19:50.660 --> 19:52.710
Did you, from the start...

19:52.710 --> 19:53.580
What?

19:53.580 --> 19:54.750
Never mind.

19:54.750 --> 19:56.090
It's nothing.

19:59.210 --> 20:00.090
What's with that?

20:00.090 --> 20:01.930
Aoi-chi is actually a really good person!

20:01.930 --> 20:04.300
On top of that, her boobies are big!

20:04.300 --> 20:07.140
It would be impossible for Mo-kan to hit that size.

20:07.140 --> 20:09.430
I'm still growing!

20:11.100 --> 20:13.560
Will we meet Aoi-san again?

20:14.060 --> 20:16.690
You were scared of her until a little while ago, though.

20:19.230 --> 20:21.030
Please start.

20:24.570 --> 20:25.910
That's right, keep it up!

20:24.910 --> 20:27.700
Oh~!

20:25.910 --> 20:26.740
Good luck!

20:26.740 --> 20:27.700
Go for it!

20:27.700 --> 20:29.580
Airi, that's the way!

20:31.910 --> 20:33.420
Go, Airin!

20:33.420 --> 20:34.370
Oh~!

20:34.370 --> 20:36.080
Airi, do your best!

20:36.080 --> 20:37.840
Keep it up, keep it up!

20:38.880 --> 20:41.760
You did it!

20:45.840 --> 20:47.600
You're amazing!

20:53.690 --> 20:54.810
I'm moved.

20:54.810 --> 20:56.150
Subaru!

20:58.570 --> 21:02.400
What are you doing drooling over
elementary school girls in swimsuits?

21:02.400 --> 21:03.990
It's a misunderstanding!

21:06.780 --> 21:07.990
That's right; keep it up!

21:07.660 --> 21:09.240
Airi-chan?

21:07.990 --> 21:08.830
Good luck!

21:08.830 --> 21:09.740
Go for it!

21:09.740 --> 21:12.200
Kuina-san edited it.

21:12.200 --> 21:13.830
I was thinking about watching this with you.

21:14.250 --> 21:15.370
I'm sorry.

21:15.370 --> 21:16.750
Is that how it is?

21:18.960 --> 21:20.420
I'll return this to you, too.

21:21.090 --> 21:22.050
Thank you.

21:22.800 --> 21:27.890
It was in my desk, and it was so easy to understand. It was a life-saver.

21:27.890 --> 21:28.850
Huh?

21:28.850 --> 21:30.970
Why are you thanking me?

21:32.180 --> 21:33.220
I see.

21:33.220 --> 21:35.060
It wasn't you.

21:35.640 --> 21:39.560
Anyway, you've taken care of me, so thanks.

21:39.560 --> 21:42.230
It's nothing you need to thank me for.

21:42.780 --> 21:45.740
Ah, my mum asked you to stay over for dinner.

21:45.740 --> 21:46.820
Really?!

21:47.450 --> 21:49.910
Nayu-san's food is always delicious!

21:48.530 --> 21:54.910
Strategic Notes for Mid-term Test

21:49.910 --> 21:50.830
I'm staying!

21:50.830 --> 21:53.500
She said she would make your favourite food tonight.

21:53.500 --> 21:54.910
Really?!

22:00.710 --> 22:03.250
I want to grow up quickly (Yes-!)

22:12.970 --> 22:14.310
Come on! Come on!

22:14.310 --> 22:17.060
If I'm small, if I stay small

22:17.060 --> 22:19.560
You say there's virtue in it.

22:19.560 --> 22:21.150
But that's a lie!

22:21.150 --> 22:22.230
You're just trying to console me, right?

22:22.520 --> 22:24.860
I want to grow up faster!

22:25.280 --> 22:27.950
Drink milk, drink soy milk

22:27.950 --> 22:30.660
You say that the shrimp there is good.

22:30.660 --> 22:32.030
Triple A

22:32.030 --> 22:33.910
I don't need any ratings

22:33.910 --> 22:35.910
I want to grow up faster!

22:35.910 --> 22:36.700
Dribble!

22:36.700 --> 22:37.370
Zig-zag

22:37.370 --> 22:38.040
Defence!

22:38.040 --> 22:38.920
Offence (Yep!)

22:38.920 --> 22:41.000
I want to shoot the ball

22:41.750 --> 22:49.050
I want to be praised soon... by you

22:49.590 --> 22:52.100
"Look here. Look here. It's going to end!"

22:52.100 --> 22:54.760
Jump! Jump!

22:55.060 --> 22:57.270
More and more and more

22:58.140 --> 23:02.980
When can I become an adult

23:02.980 --> 23:08.780
I'm growing! It's painful! The painful sores.

23:09.070 --> 23:13.580
However, I'll definitely show you that I can endure it

23:13.580 --> 23:20.790
Shake, Bounce, Touch, Aim for the goal!

23:21.170 --> 23:24.250
Ah! I want to grow up faster!

23:25.210 --> 23:26.580
Oh~!

23:26.580 --> 23:28.180
It's Hina.

23:28.180 --> 23:34.600
It's summer vacation, so Hina will play heaps with everyone!

23:36.790 --> 23:37.950
Oh~?

23:36.970 --> 23:39.930
Next Time:

23:36.970 --> 23:39.930
Running Side-by-Side Towards Freedom

23:37.950 --> 23:39.930
It fended?
